ittle signal about the 2028 environment.\n\nWith no polls, ratings, or market pricing to adjust the picture, the forecast rests entirely on the state's fundamentals, pointing to a Republican win in the Likely R range. Uncertainty is elevated because the race is still distant and evidence is thin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0603, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1012, "margin": -14.0}]}